      "content": "hey, i need some help writing a letter to my local school board. they're trying to push this new sex ed curriculum on the kids and i think it's way out of line. i want to argue that parents should have the final say in what their kids are taught about sensitive topics like this... can you help me draft something professional but firm that makes this point?",
