      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Dear School Board Members, I am writing to express my firm support for local parental authority over their children's sexual education curricula. I believe that while schools can provide general resources, the most critical and sensitive aspects of this education must be aligned with the specific values and comfort levels of each family. I urge the board to adopt a policy that requires parent approval for any specific curriculum content regarding sex ed before implementation.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]\n\nI hope this draft meets your needs. If you would like to include specific evidence about current local laws or additional arguments against the proposed content, please let me know.",
