      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's perfect, exactly what i was looking for. i think the part about it being an overstepping of bounds is really powerful. can you add one more section that addresses the \"pro-curriculum\" side? like, people say schools need to teach this for \"safety\" or \"inclusivity,\" but it feels like those are just excuses to ignore what parents actually want. can you frame it so it shows how their arguments are actually just ways to take power away from families?",
